@startuml
title F3 - Real-time Allocation, Shelf-life Pricing, Reservation and Quote
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam RoundCorner 15
skinparam wrapWidth 220

|System|
start
:Allocation worker takes the next SO (ordered by AcceptedAt, tie-break SO code);
:Create allocation attempt (AttemptNumber, start time);
:Read one configuration snapshot (weights, service radius, transit/ETA, MLOR fallback, discount version);
repeat
  :Read stock with Version (no long database lock);
  repeat
    :Take next SO line (remaining shortfall R);
    :Candidates: active warehouses in Region / radius, batches of the SKU still in date;
    :Remove quantity under active Inventory Lock
(Available = Physical - Reserved - active locks);
    :Compute ETA to the Retailer;
    :Apply MLOR (SKU > Category > default) - drop batches below threshold at ETA;
    :Score = weighted FEFO shelf-life + distance + coverage fQ, rank (fixed tie-break);
    :Take min(batch available, R) from the best batch, repeat until R = 0;
  repeat while (More lines?) is (yes)
  if (Every line fully covered?) then (yes)
    :Base price = list price after the selected quantity promotion;
    :Look up shelf-life discount % per batch at ETA, final price = base x (1 - HSD %);
    :Store B1-B4 trace and price components;
    :BEGIN transaction - conditional UPDATE per balance row
(Version = expected AND Available >= qty, Reserved += qty, Version += 1);
    if (Every row updated?) then (yes)
      :Create Reservation / Allocation / OrderReserve transaction, COMMIT;
      :Issue final quote with ExpiresAt, SO = Quoted;
      :Notify Retailer / Sales (MLOR and scores are not exposed);
      break
    else (version changed or stock gone)
      :ROLLBACK the whole SO;
    endif
  else (no - short)
    :Discard tentative allocations;
    :SO = OutOfStock, report short SKUs (no reservation held);
    stop
  endif
repeat while (Retry < 3?) is (reload stock, recompute)
if (Reserved and quoted?) then (no)
  :Attempt = Conflict, SO = AllocationConflict, no partial reservation;
  :Queue technical retry for Admin/Operator;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|Retailer|
if (Reject quote or quote expires?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Close quote, release all reservations once (OrderRelease);
  :SO = QuoteRejected / QuoteExpired;
  stop
else (no - go to F4)
endif

|Admin/Operator|
:Browse allocation attempts and trace (read-only);
:Retry only technical failures / AllocationConflict (new attempt);
note right: No batch-run button, no plan approval, no manual batch edit

|System|
:Hand over Quoted SO + final quote + active reservation to F4;
stop
@enduml
